  "stageId": "a003_01",
  "title": "火山制造",
  "storyCode": "OF-1",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "de005da847acf2ce971c089bcebef872454aafdc2a25fd1132a21a2f3c64fb0a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "普罗旺斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "普罗旺斯，我真的真的不能把这里烧干净吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些长得毫无意义的树枝和草实在是太碍事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这已经是一小时内你第十次抱怨了，天火大小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本来我就只是想来验证一下我的疑惑而已，顺便帮艾雅法拉小姐收集一些样本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是你自己提出要一起来实地勘察的，要是实在忍受不了这里的生态环境的话，也不用强忍着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在大家应该都在海边玩，你直接回去和大家汇合就好，你完全不用跟我来受这种罪的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我才不放心你这么乱来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然有你这样的天灾信使在，只有以我的知识储备，才能保证火焰环境下的你们不出什么意外状况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样的话，万一反而在山上引起大火就不妙了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然我知道你能应付那种情况......这一次我们毕竟只是来度假的，还是不要引起什么混乱比较好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "否则到时候又要给博士他们添麻烦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，看在博士和阿米娅的面子上，忍耐一下也没什么问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诶，那边有一堆黑色的石头你看到了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像是黑曜石什么的，我过去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心一点，别在这一带乱跑。尤其是不要随意用火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......应付这位小姐可比实地勘察要累多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，真奇怪......即使是夏天，这里的气温......也有些反常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大尾巴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我说，大尾巴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？欸，你是在叫我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你从刚才起有闻到什么奇怪的味道吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么说的话，的确有点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔。很微弱，但是我敢肯定不是错觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火山气体排出的量比我想象中要多，而且艾雅法拉交给我的检测符文也已经有反应了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看上去不用我做什么，搞不好再过一段时间，这里就自然会变成一片火海哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这座火山的确有可能有问题......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是更多的我们只能向艾雅法拉小姐求证了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这边，岩壁上还有些样本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，这些就够了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "样品数据可以用临时的仪器做点检测，然后发回罗德岛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾雅法拉那一头应该会最快作出后续数据分析。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是从这些黑曜石的触感看来......我也不知道，这里的黑曜石感觉有点特殊，不像是普通的黑曜石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "加上刚才闻到的那股味道以及这里的气温......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然我也不确定，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你到底想说什么，支支吾吾的，干脆一点！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来啊！不过是几个虫子而已！看我就在这里把你们都收拾掉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可恶，裙子的下摆卡住了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有、有没有人在这附近啊！为什么这里的源石虫会聚集这么多啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不要过来啊！谁来帮帮我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是求救声！海滩那边传来的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们快过去看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，等等我啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
